OL,8,G0306 Outlook
OL,9,     FIn 1977, Judy Heumann led an
OL,10,     Fhistoric protest that made
OL,11,     Fdisability discrimination illegal
OL,12,     Fin the US and equality the new
OL,13,     Fstatus quo. Her life story became
OL,14,     Fthe film Being Heumann.
OL,15,G0350 Witness History
OL,16,     FIn 1982, the state of Texas began
OL,17,     Fusing a new method to execute
OL,18,     Fprisoners: lethal injection.
OL,19,     FCharlie Brooks became the first
OL,20,     Fperson to be put to death this
OL,21,     Fway.
